# NIRVANA AI

# Brand Guidelines

---

# 1. Brand Overview

Nirvana AI is a technology company focused on the development and implementation of Artificial Intelligence and software automation solutions designed to improve operational efficiency and enable business scalability.

The name **Nirvana** represents the concept of eliminating friction and suffering. In the context of business technology, this translates into **removing inefficient processes and enabling smooth operational flow through intelligent systems**.

Nirvana AI combines advanced technology with elegant design to create solutions that feel powerful yet simple.

The brand identity reflects a balance between:

• Advanced artificial intelligence
• Operational clarity
• Futuristic innovation
• Elegant minimalism

The goal is to communicate **technology that feels intelligent, calm, and powerful rather than chaotic or overly complex.**

### The brand tone should always feel:

• Intelligent
• Modern
• Elegant
• Futuristic
• Minimalistic
• Professional
• Technologically advanced

---

# 2. Logo

## Primary Logo

The Nirvana AI logo is the central visual identifier of the brand.

It combines:

• A **circular flowing energy symbol**
• A **glowing central point representing intelligence**
• **Modern futuristic typography**

The circular symbol represents:

• Flow of information
• Continuous optimization
• AI intelligence cycles
• Harmony between technology and simplicity

The central glow symbolizes:

• Insight
• Intelligence
• Awareness
• AI processing power

## Logo Versions

Acceptable logo variations include:

• Primary logo on dark background
• Light logo on dark background
• Dark logo on light background
• Icon-only symbol version

## Logo Rules

The logo should:

• Maintain its original proportions
• Maintain sufficient surrounding space
• Be clearly visible against the background

The logo **should never**:

• Be stretched
• Be rotated
• Be recolored outside brand colors
• Have effects applied that alter its design

